  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SA Health Facilities Asset Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO will help build a software for South Africa&#x2019;s National Department of Health to enable the department to understand and manage the needs of healthcare facilities. This will be achieved through conducting an audit of assets and procurement processes at selected health facilities and thereafter launching a platform that will support: 
&#x2022;            Rehabilitation of Healthcare facilities and equipment, including civil works where appropriate
&#x2022;            Comprehensive maintenance for the project duration
&#x2022;            Training &amp; Competencies development
&#x2022;            Financing
&#x2022;            Professional project development and implementation</narrative>
  </description>
